==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|гомно́}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|говьно}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*govьno}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*gawāˀ}}, of uncertain origin.

