{{inh+|ru|orv|пизда|пизда́}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*pīzdà}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*pīˀsdāˀ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*písdeh₂}}.
